{
    "title": "Easy Homescreen",
    "description": "<b>Simplify your device. Simplify your life.</b>\r\n\r\nDo you ever feel overwhelmed with your phone? Or struggle to find apps you need quickly?\r\n\r\n<b>Easy Homescreen</b> is a launcher that replaces the Android interface and simplifies your phone with easy menus, larger text and buttons, and minimal aesthetic.\r\n\r\nLife is complicated enough without a phone that overstimulates. Make your smartphone an oasis of tranquility and elegant design. \r\n\r\n<b>Easy to Read</b>\r\nThe home screen uses larger fonts and simplified controls. Large text makes it easy to see what you\u2019re looking for, and with large buttons you won\u2019t have to worry about trying to click on tiny icons to get where you need.\r\n\r\n<b>Simple Menu</b>\r\nThe Easy Homescreen app consists of a simple screen containing the options you choose, including apps, shortcuts, text conversations, contacts and more. It also uses text labels rather than icons, making navigation more simple than ever.\r\n\r\n<b>Minimal</b>\r\nOur phones can serve as a huge source of distraction and overwhelm if we let them. Organize your apps simply, and keep your mind clear to focus on things in life that are most important to you.\r\n\r\n<b>Beautiful Aesthetic</b>\r\nDisplay all of your apps in an aesthetically pleasing way so your phone can bring you all the vibes. Life is too short to have mismatched icons scattered all over your phone causing chaos and stress.\r\n\r\n<b>Utility Features</b>\r\nIncludes commonly used features you can access quickly from your homescreen. Maximizes ease of use and productivity.\r\n\r\n- Weather\r\nEasily access the current weather and future forecasts.  Click on the weather widget at the top of your homescreen to view more detailed weather forecasts.\r\n\r\nBy clicking \u201cinstall\u201d, I accept and agree to install Easy Homescreen and setting the application\u2019s search functionality to that provided by the service and the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy. The app will update your search settings and will change your Homescreen search experience to use Yahoo.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Simplify your device. Simplify your life.</b><br><br>Do you ever feel overwhelmed with your phone? Or struggle to find apps you need quickly?<br><br><b>Easy Homescreen</b> is a launcher that replaces the Android interface and simplifies your phone with easy menus, larger text and buttons, and minimal aesthetic.<br><br>Life is complicated enough without a phone that overstimulates. Make your smartphone an oasis of tranquility and elegant design. <br><br><b>Easy to Read</b><br>The home screen uses larger fonts and simplified controls. Large text makes it easy to see what you\u2019re looking for, and with large buttons you won\u2019t have to worry about trying to click on tiny icons to get where you need.<br><br><b>Simple Menu</b><br>The Easy Homescreen app consists of a simple screen containing the options you choose, including apps, shortcuts, text conversations, contacts and more. It also uses text labels rather than icons, making navigation more simple than ever.<br><br><b>Minimal</b><br>Our phones can serve as a huge source of distraction and overwhelm if we let them. Organize your apps simply, and keep your mind clear to focus on things in life that are most important to you.<br><br><b>Beautiful Aesthetic</b><br>Display all of your apps in an aesthetically pleasing way so your phone can bring you all the vibes. Life is too short to have mismatched icons scattered all over your phone causing chaos and stress.<br><br><b>Utility Features</b><br>Includes commonly used features you can access quickly from your homescreen. Maximizes ease of use and productivity.<br><br>- Weather<br>Easily access the current weather and future forecasts.  Click on the weather widget at the top of your homescreen to view more detailed weather forecasts.<br><br>By clicking \u201cinstall\u201d, I accept and agree to install Easy Homescreen and setting the application\u2019s search functionality to that provided by the service and the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy. The app will update your search settings and will change your Homescreen search experience to use Yahoo.",
